              "smiles": "Nc1c(C(=O)O)nnn1C(=O)c1ccccc1"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

This route involves two reactions and results in commercially available precursors. The cost of the commercially available precursors should be checked to ensure it does not exceed the budget. 

